# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates: the
# prototyper's, other isolated subagents' and `claude --worktree`. Only files
# that match a line here AND are gitignored are copied (.gitignore syntax).
# Local config only. Never list secrets (.env, keys, credentials): a worktree
# copy is one more place for them to leak from.
project.local.yaml
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
# A Besfa game's shared Cargo target (`besfa new` writes it, with this
# machine's path). Without it a worktree builds Bevy from scratch.
.cargo/config.toml
